 {title:'Ready, little friend?',text:'Beat four Caterpie. Learn Thunderbolt. Find boards. Build our way home.',zh:'打败4只绿毛虫，学会十万伏特，找到木板，搭桥回家。',pos:[-4,4,8],look:[-4.5,.7,1]}
