function updateIntro(dt){if(window.wordHelpActive)return;storyTime+=dt;const s=storyShots[storyIndex],p=new THREE.Vector3(...s.pos),aim=new THREE.Vector3(...s.look);if(reduced)camera.position.copy(p);else camera.position.copy(storyFrom).lerp(p,THREE.MathUtils.smoothstep(Math.min(storyTime,1.4),0,1.4));camera.lookAt(aim);}
